    id: "gen-2026-10-11-05",
    slug: "royal-bank-of-scotland-import-to-xero",
    title: "How to Import Royal Bank of Scotland into Xero (2026)",
    excerpt: "Import Royal Bank of Scotland statements into Xero, then set up bank rules to auto-categorize transactions and make monthly reconciliation a one-click job.",
    featureImage: "/blog/royal-bank-of-scotland-import-to-xero.webp",
    author: "Sarah Mitchell",
    tags: ["rbs","xero","bank rules","reconciliation"],
