    title: "RBC Bank Statement PDF to Excel: Password-Protected PDFs",
    excerpt: "Hand your accountant clean data, not locked PDFs. Unlock Royal Bank of Canada statements, convert them to Excel in batches, and tidy bilingual descriptions.",
    featureImage: "/blog/royal-bank-of-canada-rbc-password-protected-pdf.webp",
    author: "James Park",
