    title: "Convert ING Bank Statement PDF to CSV for QuickBooks",
    excerpt:
      "Automate monthly bookkeeping: convert ING Bank PDF statements to CSV for QuickBooks. Build a repeatable workflow with bank rules and a monthly checklist.",
    featureImage: "/blog/ing-bank-convert-to-csv-quickbooks.webp",
    author: "Sarah Mitchell",
