    slug: "punjab-national-bank-statements-for-tax-filing",
    title: "Convert PNB Bank Statement PDF to Excel for Tax Filing",
    excerpt: "NRIs with PNB accounts: convert PNB bank statement PDF to Excel in seconds, organize a full year of transactions, and make FBAR and US tax filing painless.",
    featureImage: "/blog/punjab-national-bank-statements-for-tax-filing.webp",
